{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428100-thankyou-onyx-path","id":428100,"title":"Thankyou Onyx Path!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-04T14:08:08-08:00","id":428100,"title":"Thankyou Onyx Path!","content":"Hello all!<br /> <br /> So I'd like to thank everyone who worked on W:TF 2e in whatever fashion - writing, art, editing, whatever it may be. The book is EVERYTHING I hoped it would be and so much more. It's honestly what I thought 1E lacked and I personally think it blows Blood &amp; Smoke out of the water. I've skimmed over every section as I'm due to run a game in a few weeks, but I couldn't be happier. So truly, thank you to all who worked on it!<br /> <br /> (Also, major points for the Urshul art at the start of the book. Utterly gorgeous!)<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> Mabs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/128x125q90/90/w20supportergarou125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1612-mabs","name":"Mabs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1612_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T14:39:03-08:00","id":428138,"title":"","content":"Let's start saying that Werewolf the Forsaken came into my life when I was 16 or 15 if I remember well.<br /> By the way, this game came in a particolar moment.<br /> I always have had a lot of trouble when I was in the high school, but this game...I think it changed something.<br /> Maybe my immagination towards supernatural stories and my vision about werewolves ( always my favorite myth since I was a kid).<br /> I passed years playing at my table, WtF or crossover chronicle, both classic and new world of darkness.<br /> Hard years, with work, family and life in general. But I have had three things: arts, martial arts, and Werewolf.<br /> Thanks to werewolf I know a lot of special friends ( they aren't on the forum btw), lived beautiful adventures in the name of the pack, the brotherhood, the hunt, the struggle.<br /> <br /> So please, let me share with you this artwork made by me, for you.<br /> I know, it seems that I'm doing some kind of sponsor for myself, but believe me: this game is in my <b><u>heart</u></b>. Really.<br /> I'm an illustrator and this is my way to say thank you.<br /> <br /> Please, accept it.<br /> Just my way to say thanks, to the developers, to the players, for this amazing 2nd edition:<br /> <img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xfp1/t31.0-8/p526x296/10984594_1605673166330631_6080163662855853063_o.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> yes, I used a registered logo of the Onyx path (storm lords) and my right are reserved as an artist, btw this is a <i><u>tribute artwork. </u></i><br /> If there are something wrong with this, just delete it ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 03-04-2015, 05:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3